# Handoff race: renewals and acquisitions interleave; the generation
# counter serialises them. Losers are fenced, never resurrected.
lease 10s
acquire locks alice           # gen=1
acquire locks bob             # gen=2: bob wins the handoff race
renew locks alice 1           # alice's in-flight renew loses
expect STALE resurrect

acquire locks alice           # gen=3: alice takes it back
write locks bob 2 req-1 x     # bob's write with his now-old generation
expect STALE fenced
renew locks bob 2             # bob cannot resurrect gen 2 either
expect STALE resurrect

write locks alice 3 req-2 y
expect APPLIED
snapshot locks
